## DeepSeek Harness

`tests/e2e/real-dsh.mjs` executes a locally installed DeepSeek Harness
(`deepseek-harness` binary + `resources/app.asar`). Nothing from that
installation is copied, vendored or redistributed by this repository: the script
only spawns the installed CLI and drives its public HTTP surface.

